 sell volume, in BTC. Binance from 1-day klines (taker-buy field); Coinbase summed from every public trade (maker side 'sell' = taker buy). Each venue is judged against its own past year because Binance spot delta runs negative most days (median about -1.5% of volume), so a falling Binance CVD line by itself is normal. Buyers = 7-day net delta in the top 30% of the past year; sellers = bottom 30%. Premium compares Coinbase BTC-USD to Binance BTC-USDT closes.","errors":[]}